  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>50</mn></math>, So there will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>31</mn></math> values where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is integer, Similarly for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;there will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>31</mn></math>, so total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>62</mn></math>&nbsp;points of discontinuity</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
